<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3555] Zeppelin auth fails if `activeDirectoryRealm.groupRolesMap` is not specified.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3555</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue is discovered with &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3455?page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels%3Acomment-tabpanel&amp;amp;focusedCommentId=16517800#comment-16517800&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3455?page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels%3Acomment-tabpanel&amp;amp;focusedCommentId=16517800#comment-16517800&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Zeppelin auth fails if `activeDirectoryRealm.groupRolesMap` is not specified.&lt;br/&gt;
 Sample shiro.ini that fails:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
activeDirectoryRealm = org.apache.zeppelin.realm.ActiveDirectoryGroupRealm
activeDirectoryRealm.systemUsername = userNameA
activeDirectoryRealm.systemPassword = passwordA
activeDirectoryRealm.searchBase = CN=Users,DC=SOME_GROUP,DC=COMPANY,DC=COM
activeDirectoryRealm.url = ldap:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//ldap.test.com:389
&lt;/span&gt;#activeDirectoryRealm.groupRolesMap = &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;CN=admin,OU=groups,DC=SOME_GROUP,DC=COMPANY,DC=COM&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;admin&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;CN=finance,OU=groups,DC=SOME_GROUP,DC=COMPANY,DC=COM&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;finance&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;CN=hr,OU=groups,DC=SOME_GROUP,DC=COMPANY,DC=COM&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;hr&quot;&lt;/span&gt;
activeDirectoryRealm.authorizationCachingEnabled = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With this exception:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
Caused by: java.lang.NullPointerException
	at org.apache.zeppelin.realm.ActiveDirectoryGroupRealm.getListRoles(ActiveDirectoryGroupRealm.java:294)
	at org.apache.zeppelin.utils.SecurityUtils.getRoles(SecurityUtils.java:166)
	at org.apache.zeppelin.&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;rest&lt;/span&gt;.LoginRestApi.proceedToLogin(LoginRestApi.java:142)
	at org.apache.zeppelin.&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;rest&lt;/span&gt;.LoginRestApi.postLogin(LoginRestApi.java:199)
	at sun.reflect.NativeMethodAccessorImpl.invoke0(Native Method)
	at sun.reflect.NativeMethodAccessorImpl.invoke(NativeMethodAccessorImpl.java:62)
	at sun.reflect.DelegatingMethodAccessorImpl.invoke(DelegatingMethodAccessorImpl.java:43)
	at java.lang.reflect.Method.invoke(Method.java:498)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Workaround:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
 insert an empty line config as&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
#activeDirectoryRealm.groupRolesMap = &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;:&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
